          "quote": "The Ru-Ni-A1 alloy microstructure was characterized by a fine eutectic mixture of two distinct morphologies (Figure 4). This was assumed to be consistent with Reference 30, according to which the coarser regions represent ternary colonies of [(Ru) + /3-RuA1 + 3~1i)], while the finer particles are binary eutectics of [(Ru) + fl-RuA1].",
          "table": null,
          "figure": "Fig. 4",
          "chunk_id": "897400f93b93237c:part:001"
        }
      ]
